aluation of our retrieval evaluator and ChatGPT for the retrieval results on the PopQA dataset."},{"id":"c3","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_b56400e782a660d5","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"4.2 Retrieval Evaluator It is natural to wonder whether the retrieved docu- ments are accurate or not before using them, which is significant since irrelevant or misleading mes- sages can be identified in this way."},{"id":"c4","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_3a17d9e8221309cc","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"Discussion Preliminary experiments of employ- ing only the Correct and Incorrect actions show that the efficacy of CRAG was easily affected by the accuracy of the retrieval evaluator."},{"id":"c5","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_d27d374849b1a85a","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"Given an input query and the retrieved documents from any retriever, a lightweight retrieval evaluator is constructed to estimate the relevance score of retrieved documents to the input query (Sec- tion 4.2)."},{"id":"c6","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_bcf8892d3cc03b86","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"A retrieval evaluator is constructed to evaluate the relevance of the retrieved documents to the input, and estimate a confidence degree based on which different knowledge retrieval actions of {Correct, Incorrect, Ambiguous} can be"},{"id":"c7","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_9756a1c4de71163b","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":8,"quote":"Accuracy Our Retrieval Evaluator (T5-based) 84.3 ChatGPT 58.0 ChatGPT-CoT 62.4 ChatGPT-few-shot 64.7 Table 4: Evaluation of our retrieval evaluator and ChatGPT for the retrieval results on the PopQA dataset."},{"id":"c8","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_8825789ee01e7893","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":6,"quote":"Then, the retrieval evaluator fine- tuned in Section 4.2 is employed to calculate the relevance score of each knowledge strip."},{"id":"c9","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_6ea7de9df0aa688d","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":4,"quote":"Algorithm 1: CRAG Inference Require :E (Retrieval Evaluator), W (Query Rewriter), G (Generator) Input :x (Input question), D = {d1, d2, ..., dk} (Retrieved documents) Output :y (Generated response) 1 scorei = E evaluates the relevance of"},{"id":"c10","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_237a7b969993b98d","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":15,"quote":"B.3 Implementation Details Retrieval Evaluator: We fine-tuned the retrieval evaluator based on the lightweight T5-large (Raffel et al., 2020) pre-trained model."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_b6a22db2796e6d09","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":4,"quote":"Specifically, T5-large (Raffel et al., 2020) is adopted for initializing the retrieval evaluator and fine-tuned."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_d8bc376210a8400e","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":2,"quote":"A lightweight retrieval evaluator is designed to assess the overall quality of retrieved documents for a query."},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_bcf8892d3cc03b86","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"The accuracy of the retrieval evaluator undeniably plays a pivotal role in shaping the overall system performance, as it influences the outcomes of subsequent processes."},{"id":"c14","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_bcf8892d3cc03b86","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"d1 d2 Retrieval Retrieved Documents Correct Retrieval Evaluator Ask: If retrieved documents are correct to x?"},{"id":"c15","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_7dabedc7c1019ba1","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"The design of the Ambiguous action significantly helps to mitigate the dependence on the accuracy of the retrieval evaluator."},{"id":"c16","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_a94d56b4edaeaf5f","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":9,"quote":"Given the document retrieval results, we assessed whether the retrieval evaluator can accurately determine the overall quality of these results."},{"id":"c17","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_a94d56b4edaeaf5f","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":9,"quote":"Results reveal that the lightweight T5-based re- trieval evaluator significantly outperformed the competitive ChatGPT in all settings."},{"id":"c18","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_3a17d9e8221309cc","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"Since the retrieval evaluator is not confident in its judgment, both types of processed knowledge in Correct and Incorrect are combined to comple- ment each other."},{"id":"c19","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_07ea5d32230087ac","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":10,"quote":"Essentially, a lightweight retrieval evaluator is to estimate and trigger three knowledge retrieval actions discriminately."},{"id":"c20","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_402ce444df1ce1dd","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":4,"quote":"We utilized that as the relevance signals for fine-tuning the retrieval evaluator.2 On the other hand, the negative samples for fine-tuning were all randomly sampled from the retrieval results, which are rather similar to the input query"},{"id":"c21","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_582cfe0b42fdd34e","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":10,"quote":"While we primarily proposed to improve the RAG framework from a corrective perspective and CRAG can be seamlessly coupled with various RAG-based approaches, fine-tuning an external retrieval evaluator is inevitable."},{"id":"c22","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_7dabedc7c1019ba1","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"Discussion Preliminary experiments of employ- ing only the Correct and Incorrect actions show that the efficacy of CRAG was easily affected by the accuracy of the retrieval evaluator."},{"id":"c23","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_95bf4a60b92e659e","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":8,"quote":"To fur- ther verify the effectiveness of triggered actions designed in the retrieval evaluator, ablation tests for removing each single action in the proposed method were conducted as shown in Table 2."},{"id":"c24","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_a94d56b4edaeaf5f","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":9,"quote":"5.5 Accuracy of the Retrieval Evaluator The quality of the retrieval evaluator significantly determined the performance of the entire system."},{"id":"c25","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_d4fa8b0155abc356","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":1,"quote":"Specifically, a lightweight retrieval evaluator is designed to assess the overall quality of retrieved documents for a query, returning a confidence degree based on which dif